# Empty states

An empty list, filter, or shelf message is centered in the leftover space, the same way `/shop` says "Nothing on this shelf yet." for an empty Partials (or any other) shelf.

- Use a dashed box that fills the remaining height: `flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-dashed border-border/80 p-10 text-center`.
- The message itself is `text-sm text-muted-foreground`.
- The parent of that box is a column with `flex flex-1 flex-col`, so the message sits in the middle of the page under the heading and tabs, not stuck to the top-left.
- Do not leave an empty message as a left-aligned line.
